WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.016
Kip's hole was a mess.

2
00:00:06.017 --> 00:00:08.671
Stuff was everywhere.

3
00:00:08.672 --> 00:00:12.175
There were acorns all over the place.

4
00:00:12.176 --> 00:00:16.349
And there was no room for Kip!

5
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.611
"You don't need a nest," said Bird.

6
00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:23.230
"You need to clean up this mess!"

7
00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:28.368
"You're right, Bird," said Kip.

8
00:00:28.369 --> 00:00:31.588
"I am going to clean it up."

9
00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:34.971
"No," said Bird.

10
00:00:34.972 --> 00:00:39.372
" We are going to clean it

11
00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:47.428
up." "Let's start with these acorns," said

12
00:00:47.429 --> 00:00:50.101
Bird. "Pick out the ones you want to keep.

13
00:00:50.102 --> 00:00:52.674
And we'll throw out the rest."

14
00:00:52.675 --> 00:01:02.879
They sorted the acorns into neat piles.

15
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:08.025
Then they swept the floor.

16
00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:14.973
And they washed the dishes.

17
00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:21.223
Soon Kip's hole was nice and clean.

18
00:01:21.224 --> 00:01:23.822
"Well, Kip," said Bird.

19
00:01:23.823 --> 00:01:27.600
"Now you have plenty of room."

20
00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:29.842
Kip looked around.

21
00:01:29.843 --> 00:01:33.757
He rubbed his chin.

22
00:01:33.758 --> 00:01:36.523
"Thank you, Bird," said Kip.

23
00:01:36.524 --> 00:01:46.880
"Now I have room for more acorns!"

